        "quote": "(c) It shall be unlawful for employees, agents, guards or licensees to fail or refuse to surrender identification cards of employees whose employment has ceased to the Chief of Police within five business days after the date of cessation of employment. (Ord. 18137 § 8, 12-2-03. Code 1981 § 34-173. Code 1995 § 30-402.)",
